  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "無翼ê胡蠅"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Iānn-iānn飛ê胡蠅，有鼻著餅幼仔ê芳味，穩心仔kā伊ê四肢後跤thián開--開，歇落來桌頂，想beh tsn̄g一下khah有--leh，另外koh有一雙攑kuân-kuân ê前腿，sio-tshe tī半空中kueh來kueh去，tsiânn成pih手ńg beh做khang-khuè ê款勢。Pok-pok吐吐ê兩蕊烏仁，正爿、倒爿tsùn--一-下tsùn--一-下，是leh想講beh tuì佗一角勢，落喙去khè上kài ha̍h，tùn-tenn兩、三秒niâ，就伸前腿去踏hit塊細kah kiōng-beh看bē著ê餅幼仔，順suà ànn落來用喙tsn̄g，氣味應該是bē-bái。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我目睭皮lóng無nih，正手勻勻仔倚去伊ê尻川後，差不多20公分遠ê所在停睏--落-來，siòng-tshian-tshian雄雄出一下脆力，tuì桌面兩、三公分kuân ê所在「siù」--一-下kā掃--過--去，手蹄仔有sa著軟軟ê mi̍h件，拄好gia̍p tī tsíng頭仔縫，心肝頭暢一下，對喙huah聲講：「掠--著--ah！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā手蹄仔徙來胸前，聊聊仔peh--開 一- 縫- 仔，有siam著伊ê身軀，m̄-koh驚伊ê腹肚hōo我tēnn一下tsuh膏，伸另外hit手ê tsíng頭仔尾溜好禮仔ni--出-來，koh輕輕仔hân--著，翼股se̍h hōo走出來外口勢，m̄敢出siunn大力，tsiah-koh用正手ê tsíng甲尾，親像線tshng針鼻hiah-nī仔細膩ê手路，kā薄li-si ê翼股隨片仔tshuah掉--去，tsiah liù手hōo伊跳落來桌頂，即時有一種「bē飛--ah--honnh，看你偌gâu！」ê歡喜暗爽tī心肝頭。Tuì掠--著、tshuah翼到放落來桌頂，頭尾to無十秒，suà--落-去，踮桌頂跳kuân跳低mā是五秒niâ，就栽落去塗跤兜，無看著伊ê身影。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">論真來講，胡蠅ê跤比頭毛絲khah幼，顛倒有才調踮桌頂tshia̍k-tshia̍k-tiô，liòng不止仔kuân，定著是tsiânn勇ê款，m̄-koh tsit-tsūn ê伊，tsiok成掠狂ê潑猴，氣phut-phut koh pìnn無路來，雖bóng無隨伸跤出手kā伊juê--死，總--是án-ne kā人凌治，正經有淡薄仔夭壽骨。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsheh胡蠅、蠓仔ê人m̄是我niâ，100个人有99个ē出手kā趕、kā拍，逐工死kah tsiânn歹看ê胡蠅、蠓仔，tuì台灣頭算到台灣尾，應該是一大拖tsiah tio̍h，講--起-來我iáu算有一絲仔天良。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：</span><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/2Wy84O\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/2Wy84O</a><span style=\"font-size: small;\">）</span></p><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhSSAivvbRcxRsQzIaj6-2FJ-T9EiX_y5R-tKDD3MDPGIkmMBNmv1qxdwM_Q9goNpHO43d3vSJhyww40yq2iIhEYgssDU8mTGoytsvatJp5oUBH1C4MxiPx3b-8q5o6xhRP7m18S4xJ7gXbc_9j8zV7Hb1hDeii6njH3nyuX3kC4v-M_cuJiCYHnZShBg/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1349%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%819.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhSSAivvbRcxRsQzIaj6-2FJ-T9EiX_y5R-tKDD3MDPGIkmMBNmv1qxdwM_Q9goNpHO43d3vSJhyww40yq2iIhEYgssDU8mTGoytsvatJp5oUBH1C4MxiPx3b-8q5o6xhRP7m18S4xJ7gXbc_9j8zV7Hb1hDeii6njH3nyuX3kC4v-M_cuJiCYHnZShBg/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1349%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%819.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7frCeXv4T5DZNAiwIDvXSRu4xXYtneCudDFsSo1O5oN9pEH37mYDQy3v6za31x5BRmQz_9kyf1B-H3tE3dY4B-AGSq-r7onxoUjVktEnm1usTkLJQet4Gkwf_EVFdaN8p7xYZ6J0v6DFJxsQ2M6OzBByPBdO9ealKOdztaQ51nCOOmtchN15dVJ9DBQ/s1424/349%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-lef